    {
      "id": "key-text",
      "shape": "text",
      "role": "label",
      "face": "body",
      "text": "Blue: Ravel process. Grey: external participants. Gold cylinder: temporary files.\nGreen carries a published value, but no green arrow reaches the caller.\nThe managed process’s group includes descendants that stay in that group.\nINT goes directly to the Ravel CLI here; terminal Ctrl-C can reach only the group.\nHUP and TERM use shell statuses 129 and 143; failed propagation uses numeric fallback.\nCleanup problems cannot turn cancellation into success or permit result delivery.",
      "x": 521.95361328125,
      "y": 652.81640625,
      "anchor": "center",
      "align": "center",
      "wrapped": false,
